<LegalPageLayout title="Terms of Engagement | TitleIQ & Consultancy" description="The terms applying to an engagement with TitleIQ & Consultancy are provided or confirmed before work begins." intro="The terms applying to an engagement will be provided or confirmed before work begins."><h2 class="h4">When terms apply</h2><p>Terms of Engagement are provided or confirmed at the point an engagement is accepted, together with a Letter of Engagement describing the scope of the specific matter and the applicable fee.</p><h2 class="h4">Conveyancing services</h2><p>{site.nestNotice} Those services are subject to the terms of engagement issued by that firm.</p><h2 class="h4">Fees and disbursements</h2><p>Fee information published on this website is indicative and subject to review of the matter. Disbursements and GST are additional unless stated otherwise.</p><div class="note">A copy of the current Terms of Engagement is available on request while the final document is being prepared for publication.</div></LegalPageLayout>
